  "ruleText": "Env-A 701.03 References. For the purpose of this chapter, unless otherwise specified, the July 1, 2017 edition of title 40 of the Code of Federal Regulations (CFR) shall control all references to 40 CFR 70.\n\nSource. #8111, eff 6-26-04; ss by #9911, eff 4-26-11; ss by #12649, eff 10-24-18",
